Make the Rockchip RTL8723DS vendor driver (v5.10.1-20-g5af20e016, Luckfox SDK copy)
build as an external module against the 5.10.160 kernel.

- crc32(): driver function collides with the kernel's crc32() macro -> rtw_crypto_crc32
- internal hostap SHA-256 collides with <crypto/sha.h> names -> rtw_sha256_*
- struct sched_param moved to <uapi/linux/sched/types.h> (5.9)
- procfs: struct file_operations -> struct proc_ops (5.6)
- cfg80211: .mgmt_frame_register -> .update_mgmt_frame_registrations (5.8),
  thin wrapper that keeps the driver's AUTH-frame-only handling
- import the VFS_internal_... symbol namespace for filp_open/kernel_read/kernel_write
  (Rockchip/GKI kernel; the stock module imports the same namespace)

